  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Loan Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Loan Calculator</h1>\n    <form id=\"loan-form\">\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"amount\">Loan Amount ($)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"amount\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"10000\" required>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"rate\">Yearly Interest Rate (%)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"rate\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"5\" required>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"years\">Years</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"years\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" required>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\" id=\"calc-btn\">Calculate</button>\n    </form>\n    <div class=\"results\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <p><span class=\"label\">Monthly Payment:</span> <span id=\"monthly\">$0.00</span></p>\n      <p><span class=\"label\">Total Paid:</span> <span id=\"total\">$0.00</span></p>\n      <p><span class=\"label\">Total Interest:</span> <span id=\"interest\">$0.00</span></p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card-bg: #16213e;\n  --primary: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --accent: #0f3460;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 4px solid var(--primary);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  padding: 2rem;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\ninput {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 0.5rem;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n}\n\ninput:hover {\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n}\n\ninput:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--primary);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 0.75rem;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n  margin-top: 0.5rem;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ff6b81;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.results {\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n  padding-top: 1rem;\n  border-top: 2px solid var(--accent);\n}\n\n.results p {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n.label {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const form = document.getElementById('loan-form');\nconst amountInput = document.getElementById('amount');\nconst rateInput = document.getElementById('rate');\nconst yearsInput = document.getElementById('years');\nconst monthlyEl = document.getElementById('monthly');\nconst totalEl = document.getElementById('total');\nconst interestEl = document.getElementById('interest');\n\nfunction calculate() {\n  const amount = parseFloat(amountInput.value) || 0;\n  const annualRate = parseFloat(rateInput.value) || 0;\n  const years = parseFloat(yearsInput.value) || 0;\n\n  const months = years * 12;\n  let monthly = 0;\n  let total = 0;\n  let totalInterest = 0;\n\n  if (months > 0 && amount > 0) {\n    if (annualRate === 0) {\n      monthly = amount / months;\n    } else {\n      const monthlyRate = annualRate / 100 / 12;\n      monthly = amount * monthlyRate * Math.pow(1 + monthlyRate, months) / (Math.pow(1 + monthlyRate, months) - 1);\n    }\n    total = monthly * months;\n    totalInterest = total - amount;\n  }\n\n  monthlyEl.textContent = '$' + monthly.toFixed(2);\n  totalEl.textContent = '$' + total.toFixed(2);\n  interestEl.textContent = '$' + totalInterest.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nform.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  calculate();\n});\n\n[amountInput, rateInput, yearsInput].forEach(function (input) {\n  input.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n});\n\ncalculate();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Loan Calculator\n\nA simple offline loan calculator with a pixel-art themed UI.\n\n## Features\n\n- Enter loan amount, yearly interest rate, and years.\n- Calculates monthly payment, total paid, and total interest.\n- Results update automatically as you type or when you click Calculate.\n- Responsive design works from 360px wide.\n- Keyboard accessible with visible focus states.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or internet connection required.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – main page\n- `style.css` – styles\n- `script.js` – calculation logic",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
